1: //! Battery & Smart Battery Telemetry Decoders for DJI `.txt` Flight Logs.
2: //!
3: //! Provides zero-allocation decoders for:
4: //! - Record Type 7 (`CenterBatteryFlightRecordDataType`): Disambiguates Variant A (Energy Summary)
5: //!   from Variant B (Individual Cell Voltage Array 1..=14).
6: //! - Record Type 8 (`PushedBatteryFlightRecordDataType`): Secondary pack telemetry on dual-battery craft.
7: //! - Record Type 22 (`SmartBatteryGroupDataType`): Battery health ledger, countdowns, warning bitmask.
8: //! - Record Type 6 (`MCTripodStateFlightRecordDataType`): Motorized landing gear state.
9: //! - Record Type 50 (`FlightRecordRecover`): Plaintext crash recovery packet with component serials.
